			"notes": "- Updated to the latest version of AE2, removing some deprecated method usage for Source P2P Tunnels\n- Added the ability for Wixies and Wixie Cauldrons to read potential recipes from nearby Pattern Providers (thanks @Jarva!)\n- Removed redundant Creative Source Cell; AE2's own Creative cell handles any and every key type\n- Fully optimised all textures\n- Added externally-contributed Japanese (@twister716), Russian (@Heimdallr-1) and Turkish (@RuyaSavascisi) translations."
		},
